OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial swim held for man who
OL,4,Adied in fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack Berger died 10 years ago after
OL,7,Fslipping and hitting his head while
OL,8,Fwalking his girlfriend to a bus stop.
OL,10,FOn Saturday, his mum, Wendy Kane, and
OL,11,FShoreham's Natural Born Swimmers
OL,12,Fcommemorated the anniversary of his
OL,13,Fdeath with a fancy dress swim at Sea
OL,14,FLanes pool in Brighton.
OL,16,FIt raised money for Air Ambulance
OL,17,FCharity Kent Surrey Sussex, which
OL,18,Fresponded to Jack's fall on 5 November
OL,19,F2016, airlifting him to London's St
OL,20,FGeorge's Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
